===Etymology===
From Common Germanic ''*tīma-'', whence also Old English ''[[tima|tīma]]'' ( > Modern English ''[[time]]''). The Germanic source is related to ''*tīði-'' ‘time’, compare Old Norse [[tíð]]).

===Noun===
